OL,3,GNEWSACouncils agree to scrap #147m
OL,4,Awaste treatment centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Derbyshire councils have agreed to
OL,7,Fdecommission and dispose of a waste
OL,8,Ftreatment centre which has never been
OL,9,Fused and has cost the taxpayer just
OL,10,Fover #147m.
OL,12,FThe Sinfin Waste Treatment Centre in
OL,13,FDerby failed initial testing in 2017,
OL,14,Fand talks earlier this year were unable
OL,15,Fto find anyone to take on management of
OL,16,Fthe project.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
