OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACouncils agree to scrap #147m
OL,4,Awaste treatment centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerby City Council and Derbyshire
OL,7,FCounty Council, which jointly own the
OL,8,Fsite, said a "comprehensive review"
OL,9,Ffound getting rid of the incinerator
OL,10,Fwould be "the best option to protect
OL,11,Fthe interests of council taxpayers".
OL,13,FFormer city council leader and Labour
OL,14,FMP for Derby South, Baggy Shanker, told
OL,15,Fthe BBC the move was the "right
OL,16,Fdecision".
